            "review_title": "Review at Gia Huy",
            "review_text": "Eric L\nCalonne-Ricouart, France246 contributions\n0\nAbsolutely delicious\nMar 2024 • Family\nPerfect place, opposite the PANDARUS RESORT hotel (where the prices of food and drinks are overpriced).\nSo here in Vietnam I tasted the spaghetti bolognese and FRANKLY it's worthy of an Italian restaurant.\nThere are many dishes at very, very inexpensive prices (eg: 1 Pina colada cocktail at 69,000 dong = €2.56, spaghetti bolognese at the same price €2.56..)\nThe place is clean, the service is fast despite the impressive menu but it's delicious, the chef is very pleasant.\nThe place can be a little noisy because the road is right next to it but go there without any problem\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten March 24, 2024",
