            "review_text": "ruggero52\nMonterubbiano, Italy4234 contributions\n0\nThe knife was missing\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nCrowded by residents of the resort just opposite, this restaurant offers a variety of dishes. There are over 400 items on the menu. They range from meat to fish, from lobster to pizza. Upon our arrival, a new tablecloth was placed and cutlery was brought. The knife was missing. Knife that would have been very useful for filleting fish.\nIn any case we ate well and spent little. When paying the bill the owner offered us some excellent bananas\nShow original\nWritten February 29, 2024",
