            "review_title": "Review at Gia Huy",
            "review_text": "Zara\n22 contributions\n0\nCheap food, great place to eat.\nDec 2019 • Couples\nReally love this restaurant. Their prices are good and the food is good too!\n\nTheir fish and scallops are super super fresh. The 2 of us ate non-stop (we did not eat lunch so our dinner was 2 meals combined into 1). Ordered a lot of food and total was 400+k VND. \n\nThere is a shop next to the restaurant that sells some small provisions. We bought 1.5 litres of water for 10, 000 VND. I think that is a fair price. \n\nWe loved the garlic butter scallops and red snapper. The pumpkin soup with cheese was a hit with me but a miss with my partner. Wings were okay. French fries were great. Soft drinks are 10,000 or 11,000 VND. \n\nSuper good value. Would come again!\nRead more\nWritten December 22, 2019",
